        "original_id": "8f65f74a-fb0e-5414-b6d1-238cbc5190ae",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jerome Benton, Steven Berkoff, Kristin Scott Thomas, Francesca Annis\n- Films and Awards: Under the Cherry Moon, Howard the Duck, BAFTA TV Awards, 7th Golden Raspberry Awards, Lillie\n\nFacts:\n- In 1979, Francesca Annis won the BAFTA TV Award for Best Actress for the ITV serial \"Lillie\".\n- Francesca Annis was a six-time BAFTA TV Award nominee.\n- Kristin Scott Thomas made her feature film debut in \"Under the Cherry Moon\".\n- \"Under the Cherry Moon\" also starred Jerome Benton, Steven Berkoff, Kristin Scott Thomas, and Francesca Annis.\n- At the 7th Golden Raspberry Awards, \"Under the Cherry Moon\" tied with \"Howard the Duck\" for Worst Picture, marking the first tie in that category.",
